{"title":"What's My Name","artist":"Descendants","sourceId":"reference:K9QTcPVo4Q5vU6ynHUMA","sourceHash":"d41cacf026e67995b9ab54ca38218a7954180be6091e164bab14b6699eb3f98f","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":8.74,"end":10.78,"text":"This is all hands on deck","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":10.78,"end":12.66,"text":"Callin' out to lost boys and girls","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":12.66,"end":14.83,"text":"I'm gettin' tired of the disrespect","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":14.83,"end":16.83,"text":"We won't stop 'til we rule the world","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":16.83,"end":19.1,"text":"It's our time, we up next (Next, next)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":19.1,"end":21.18,"text":"Our sail's about to be set (Set, set)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":21.18,"end":23.38,"text":"They ain't seen nothing yet","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":23.38,"end":25.47,"text":"Tell 'em who's in charge so they don't forget","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":25.47,"end":28.14,"text":"What's my name? What's my name? (Uma)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":28.14,"end":29.67,"text":"Say it louder","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":29.67,"end":32.47,"text":"What's my name? What's my name? (Uma)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":32.47,"end":33.92,"text":"Feel the power","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":33.92,"end":36.92,"text":"No one's gonna stop us, soon the world will be ours (Oh)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":38.26,"end":40.27,"text":"What's my name? What's my name?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":40.27,"end":42.39,"text":"What's it? What's it? Say it, say it (Say it loud)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":42.39,"end":45.39,"text":"(Uma, Uma) All eyes on me, let me see 'em","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":46.59,"end":49.59,"text":"(Uma, Uma) What's it? What's it? Say it, say it","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":50.75,"end":52.74,"text":"(Uma-a-a)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":52.74,"end":54.9,"text":"(Uma, Uma, la-la-Um)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":54.9,"end":57.11,"text":"(Uma, Uma, la-la-Uma)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":57.11,"end":59.14,"text":"(Uma, Uma, la-la-Um)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":59.14,"end":61.23,"text":"(Uma, Uma, la-la-Um, Uma)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":61.23,"end":63.23,"text":"I'm the queen of this town","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":63.23,"end":65.15,"text":"I call the shots, you know who I am","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":65.15,"end":67.32,"text":"I don't need to wear no fake crown","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":67.32,"end":69.48,"text":"Stand up to me, you don't stand a chance","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":69.48,"end":71.68,"text":"It's our time, we up next (Next, next)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":71.68,"end":73.92,"text":"My crew's as real as it gets (Gets, gets)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":73.92,"end":75.95,"text":"The worst is now the best","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":75.95,"end":78.11,"text":"And leaving us here will be their last regret","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":78.11,"end":80.68,"text":"What's my name? What's my name? (Uma)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":80.68,"end":82.28,"text":"Say it louder","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":82.28,"end":84.83,"text":"What's my name? What's my name? (Uma)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":84.83,"end":86.6,"text":"Feel the power (Woah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":86.6,"end":89.6,"text":"No one's gonna stop us, soon the world will be ours (Yeah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":90.84,"end":92.72,"text":"What's my name? What's my name?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":92.72,"end":95.15,"text":"What's it? What's it? Say it, say it","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":95.15,"end":97.36,"text":"You know what they say, \"Bad girls have all the fun\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":97.36,"end":99.52000000000001,"text":"Never learned how to count 'cause I'm number one","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":99.52000000000001,"end":101.56,"text":"Ready, here we come, we always get our way","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":101.56,"end":104.11,"text":"It's a pirate's life, every single day, hey!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":104.11,"end":105.75999999999999,"text":"(Uma) She's the captain, I'm the first mate","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":105.75999999999999,"end":107.78999999999999,"text":"(Uma) Enemies seasick, can't see straight","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":107.78999999999999,"end":109.6,"text":"(Uma) Call 'em fish bait, throw 'em on a hook","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":109.6,"end":112.6,"text":"(Uma) Uma's so hot, they get burned if they look (Oh)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":114.75,"end":117.75,"text":"It's all eyes on me, let me see 'em","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":118.91,"end":121.91,"text":"I see your eyes on me, boys, hey!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":122.88,"end":125.88,"text":"You know what my name is","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":126.55,"end":129.55,"text":"Say it, say it louder","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":130.91,"end":131.99,"text":"Hook me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":131.99,"end":133.11,"text":"Ha-ha","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":133.11,"end":136.11,"text":"Hahahaha","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":137.2,"end":139.55,"text":"Ho!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":139.55,"end":142.35,"text":"Woo!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":142.35,"end":143.5,"text":"Hahahaha","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":143.5,"end":145.51,"text":"Come on","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":145.51,"end":148.03,"text":"What's my name? What's my name? (Uma)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":148.03,"end":149.71,"text":"Say it louder (Hey)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":149.71,"end":152.19,"text":"What's my name? What's my name? (Uma)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":152.19,"end":153.99,"text":"Feel the power (Ooh, woah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":153.99,"end":155.51,"text":"No one's gonna stop us","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":155.51,"end":158.07,"text":"Soon the world will be ours (No one's gonna stop us, woah, no, no)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":158.07,"end":160.23,"text":"What's my name? What's my name? (Yeah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":160.23,"end":163.23,"text":"What's it? What's it? Say it, say it","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":165.39,"end":168.39,"text":"(Uma, Uma) All eyes on me, let me see 'em","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":168.64,"end":171.07,"text":"(Uma, Uma) What's it? What's it? Say it, say it","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":171.07,"end":174.07,"text":"(Uma, Uma) Ooh, say it louder","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":174.91,"end":177.15,"text":"(Uma, Uma) Ooh, say it louder","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":177.15,"end":179.14,"text":"What's it? What's it? Say it, say it","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":179.14,"end":181.19,"text":"(Uma, Uma, la-la-Um)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":181.19,"end":183.31,"text":"(Uma, Uma, la-la-Uma)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":183.31,"end":185.43,"text":"(Uma, Uma, la-la-Um)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":185.43,"end":188.43,"text":"(Uma, Uma, la-la-Um, Uma) Uma","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}